{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年65歲、有「樂壇判官」之稱的資深音樂人周啟生，近年頻頻於社交平台發表惹火言論。</p><p>繼早前先後點評過楊千嬅、林家謙、伍仲衡等多位音樂人後，日前他再度發文，而這次的矛頭則直指剛在爵士音樂節亮相的許志安，其言論隨即引發網民熱議。</p><p>&lt;br/&amp;g</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T14:19:09.971470+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T14:07:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T14:12:20.127641+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T14:12:20.127641+00:00","content_hash":"d3b1730019c0c01bc2dd4448aed0e4f7d8a7d98c9fc9e14ceef5fc5861532dac","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}